    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d132">

                <pb facs="0155" n="105" sameAs="frus:frus1918Russiav03/pg105"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 861.00/788</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Consul at
                        Vladivostok</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Caldwell</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1917-12-15T18:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">December 15,
                                1917, 6 p.m.</hi></date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your December 11, 6 p.m.,<anchor n="1" xml:id="d132-f1"/> last sentence garbled,
                    presume refers reported embargo. No such embargo on shipments from United States
                    exists or has existed.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
